{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45530","headline":"长安言怀寄沈彬侍郎 · 卿云","name":"长安言怀寄沈彬侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故园梨岭下，归路接天涯。\n生作长安草，胜爲边地花。\n雁南飞不到，书北寄来赊。\n堪羡神仙客，青云早致家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卿云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}